{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分心理因果交代得比X简略，尤其S04、S07、S09，人物为什么反复动摇、具体在纠结什么，不如X说得透。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词突出、话与感受交替，加上感受按音乐进程出现，更容易让没读过原文的观众边听边抓住每段重点，不必同时处理一整堆感受词。它对音乐变化的描写也明显更细，能呈现情绪如何从焦躁、怀念、短暂温暖转向失落、挣扎，最后落到自己的选择；反复出现的亲近、孤单和旧日记忆也让整首曲子的情感脉络比较完整。X的优势是人物心理动机和因果关系交代得更充分，但整体而言，Y更能兼顾即时理解、音乐同步和感受的细腻程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1f86baf4-b6d1-4661-b8ec-7d31bee09bf4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002641811520Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:27:49.380286+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99aca42bef494b9feb74d1f08d2826e1d9c0ee6d49b61d444f9c179c4cf82c70", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "